{"id":"doctora","lemma":"doctora","pos":"noun","rank":1308,"glosses":["doctor's wife"],"ipa":"/doɡˈtoɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"doctoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-doctora.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi esposa es doctora.","en":"My wife is a doctor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449848"},{"text":"En esa época, había pocas doctoras.","en":"There weren't many doctors back then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1153251"},{"text":"Ella se convirtió en doctora.","en":"She became a doctor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450334"},{"text":"Ella pensaba que yo era doctora.","en":"She thought that I was a doctor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353986"},{"text":"¿Prefieres un doctor o una doctora?","en":"Do you prefer a male or female doctor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689059"}]}